5
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,200
もったいないよ
but it'd be such a waste,

6
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,500
今日は sunday
today is Sunday!

7
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,500
楽しいこと やりたいこと
All the fun things, all the things I want to do—

8
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,200
wake up ! 始めようよ
Wake up! Let's get started.

9
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:25,500
めくりめく季節 君と次のステージへ
Through the revolving seasons, to the next stage with you!

10
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:30,000
声を合わせ 扉開けて 駆け出せ 迷わずに
Voices blending, doors opening, running forth without hesitation!

11
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:37,500
転んでも かっこ悪くても イイじゃない
