stand up ! イメージもっと 重ねて行く その先で
Stand up! Layering our images higher and higher, beyond that point...

13
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,200
いっせーのせ で 君とだけ！
On the count of three, with just you!

14
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:54,500
ハイタッチ 手たたいて 奏でる メロディを
High-five, clapping our hands to play this melody,

15
