00:55:02,410 --> 00:55:04,510
忘れずに全部言えるかな
of our adventure without forgetting?

587
00:55:04,690 --> 00:55:06,740
君から聞きたいの
I want to hear it from you.

588
00:55:06,740 --> 00:55:08,660
何回目の僕に出会った?
How many times have you met me?

589
00:55:08,660 --> 00:55:10,920
僕は変わりました
I have changed,

590
00:55:10,920 --> 00:55:13,340
新しい君に出会うために
so that I could meet the new you.

591
00:55:13,520 --> 00:55:15,620
久しぶりだねって
If I could say "It's been a while,"

592
00:55:15,620 --> 00:55:17,470
言えたならここで泣きそうか
I'd probably cry right here.

593
00:55:17,590 --> 00:55:19,580
好きとかって
Saying you like me,

594
00:55:19,580 --> 00:55:21,180
嫌いとかって
saying you hate me—

595
00:55:21,180 --> 00:55:24,560
何回だって愛を歌う君が恋しくて
I miss you singing of love over and over.

596
00:55:24,560 --> 00:55:26,630
嘘じゃない本当だよ
It's not a lie, it's true.

597
00:55:26,630 --> 00:55:28,510
また出逢おう
Let's meet again.

598
00:55:28,700 --> 00:55:31,040
僕ら“II”を嫌って“I”に戻って
Hating "II" and returning to "I",

599
00:55:31,040 --> 00:55:33,370
何回だって間違ってきたよ
we've made mistakes so many times.

600
00:55:33,570 --> 00:55:35,940
消えない後悔と 冷めない愛情が
Unfading regrets and an uncooling passion

601
00:55:35,940 --> 00:55:38,340
恋を再起動する
reboot our love.

602
00:55:38,490 --> 00:55:40,840
ほら“I”を嫌って また“II”に戻って
See, hating "I" and returning to "II",

603
00:55:40,840 --> 00:55:43,880
“III”になって愛を繋いでいこう
let's become "III" and keep connecting our love!

604
00:55:44,290 --> 00:55:46,490
言いたい感情は
The feelings I want to express,

605
00:55:46,490 --> 00:55:48,600
伝えたい正解は
the right answers I want to convey—

606
00:55:48,810 --> 00:55:51,360
想いの冒険は これからもちゃんと続いていく
our adventure of feelings will properly continue.

607
00:55:51,580 --> 00:55:54,760
3と9に乗って 言葉とか飛び越えちゃって
Riding on 3 and 9, leaping right over words,

608
00:55:54,760 --> 00:55:57,280
君も変わりました
you have also changed,

609
00:55:57,280 --> 00:55:59,480
新しい誰かに会うために
so that you could meet someone new.

610
00:55:59,720 --> 00:56:02,220
大人になりました
You've grown up.

611
00:56:02,220 --> 00:56:05,060
それだけでいいと思えた
Just that made me feel it was enough.

612
00:56:05,240 --> 00:56:07,540
好きとかって
Saying you like me,

613
00:56:07,540 --> 00:56:09,620
嫌いとかって
saying you hate me—

614
00:56:09,620 --> 00:56:12,870
何度だって愛を歌う君が恋しくて
I miss you singing of love over and over.

615
00:56:12,870 --> 00:56:15,240
嘘じゃない本当だよ
It's not a lie, it's true.

616
00:56:15,240 --> 00:56:17,470
また出逢おう
Let's meet again.

617
00:56:17,670 --> 00:56:19,550
恋をして…バカ。
Fall in love... idiot.

618
00:56:19,550 --> 00:56:21,310
愛にして…バカ。
Make it love... idiot.

619
00:56:21,310 --> 00:56:23,860
バカでいい この先もずっとこのまま
Idiocy is fine, staying like this forever.

620
00:56:24,170 --> 00:56:26,630
僕ら“II”を嫌って“I”に戻って
Hating "II" and returning to "I",

621
00:56:26,630 --> 00:56:28,990
何回だって間違ってきたよ
we've made mistakes so many times.

622
00:56:29,200 --> 00:56:31,510
消えない後悔と 冷めない愛情が
Unfading regrets and an uncooling passion

623
00:56:31,510 --> 00:56:33,890
恋を再起動する
reboot our love.

624
00:56:34,040 --> 00:56:36,490
ほら“I”を嫌って また“II”に戻って
See, hating "I" and returning to "II",

625
00:56:36,490 --> 00:56:39,280
“III”になって愛を繋いでいこう
let's become "III" and keep connecting our love!

626
00:56:39,840 --> 00:56:42,110
言いたい感情は
The feelings I want to express,

627
00:56:42,110 --> 00:56:44,290
伝えたい正解は
the right answers I want to convey—

628
00:56:44,490 --> 00:56:47,470
想いの冒険は これからもちゃんと続いていく
our adventure of feelings will properly continue.

629
00:56:47,620 --> 00:56:49,900
メーデー
Mayday,

630
00:56:49,900 --> 00:56:52,430
僕と分かっても
even if you realize it's me—

631
00:56:52,430 --> 00:56:55,420
もう抱き締めなくて良くて容易いんだよ
you don't have to hold me anymore, it's easy.

632
00:56:55,620 --> 00:56:57,780
終わらない愛を抱いていたいの
I want to hold onto an endless love.

633
00:56:57,780 --> 00:57:00,760
もっとちゃんと不安にしてよ
Make me feel even more properly uneasy.

634
00:57:00,760 --> 00:57:03,310
妄想感傷代償同盟
Delusion Sentiment Compensation Federation,

635
00:57:03,310 --> 00:57:06,040
愛を懐いて理想を号泣
embracing love and crying out ideals,

636
00:57:06,040 --> 00:57:08,660
行き場のある愛のメロディーを
giving a melody of love a place to go.

637
00:57:08,860 --> 00:57:11,840
今まで本当にありがとう
Thank you so much for everything until now.

638
00:57:11,840 --> 00:57:14,740
いつまでも君と
Forever with you,

639
00:57:14,740 --> 00:57:17,740
「こんな歌あったね」って
so we can say, "Ah, that song existed,"

640
00:57:17,740 --> 00:57:21,040
出会いを数えられるように
and count our encounters.

